{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html | sed -n '296,356p'\"","aggregated_output":"   296\t<li><b>宏观量</b>（利率、通胀）：按 D 类共同量开题<span class=\"src\">D243 第 2 条</span>。只来自一篇纯宏观文章时，只有主题在名单上才开<span class=\"src\">D191 第 3 条</span>。宏观对每家公司的正负，在判断那家公司时读主题块决定<span class=\"src\">D191 第 1 条、D195</span>。</li>\n   297\t<li><b>开题理由是封闭的</b><span class=\"src\">D184</span>：一件事属不属于五类之一，按上表逐条看，比如一个监管决定看它是不是 E 类。哪一类都不属于的不开；它是不是证据、挂到哪，照第 5 节和归档规则。</li>\n   298\t</ul>\n   299\t\n   300\t<h3>问题怎么写：PRD 06 的梯子规则，不重写</h3>\n   301\t<ul>\n   302\t<li>一个问题只问一个量的一个期间，或一件事；能各自朝相反方向走、而且分析员会分别下注的部分要分开<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 梯子第 3 条；\"分别下注\"是 D248 加的，PRD 06 签字后更新</span>，分开的每一题都要过第 4 节的测试。</li>\n   303\t<li>写成问句，不写成断言<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 Rationale</span>。</li>\n   304\t<li>结果档可核对、不重叠、不留缝，到期恰好一档成立；中间一档写明和什么比；\"小幅\"\"部分\"这种不能核对的说法不用，部分状态写成单独一档<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 梯子第 2 条</span>。标的问题的档描述业务结果；主题问题的档只写结局，不写好坏<span class=\"src\">PRD 06、D186</span>。</li>\n   305\t<li>到期日：量是它的发布日；事件是能判出结果的那天。公司的量用公司财年，别的用自然年，只开今年和明年<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 梯子第 5 条；约束性义务例外，D185</span>。</li>\n   306\t</ul>\n   307\t\n   308\t<h2 id=\"opening\"><span class=\"num\">4</span>开题标准</h2>\n   309\t<blockquote><p><b>一个问题值得单独追，要同时满足三件事：它的答案可能改变仓位；能在一个日期用公开材料判出落在哪一档；库里没有问题在问同一件事。</b>开多少个是判断的结果，不是目标<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6；评审 §1</span>。</p>\n   310\t<p>颗粒度按一个高端对冲基金分析员：只有会单独下注的大事开题，鸡毛蒜皮不开题（它的陈述留不留照第 5 节判）；同一个赌注的几种说法是一题，截止日、里程碑、财年和日历年各按本节\"同一题、续期，还是另一题\"里的那一条判<span class=\"src\">D248</span>。</p>\n   311\t<p>另有一条前提：新问题要有独立的投资判断；一个新产品、一个新数字、一个更窄的范围，单凭这些不开<span class=\"src\">D201</span>。</p></blockquote>\n   312\t\n   313\t<h3>四个测试<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6</span></h3>\n   314\t<ol class=\"steps\">\n   315\t<li><b>值得追</b>写得出\"这个结果会改变哪项收入、利润、现金或信用风险、竞争位置\"吗？写不出就留作证据，不开题。\"数字很大\"不算理由。单笔交易、产品、项目，规模够不上改变公司的收入、利润、现金或信用风险的，不开题，陈述留不留照第 5 节判<span class=\"src\">D248 第 6 条：问的就是小交易、小产品</span>；这一测试的其余理由（包括竞争位置）不变。</li>\n   316\t<li><b>独立意义</b>能写出两个情景吗：其他问题的答案不变，只有这一题相反，而对业务的判断确实不同？写不出就优先作为证据<span class=\"src\">评审 §1 第 3、8 条</span>。评审里的一个判例：NVIDIA FY2027 总收入题判为数据中心收入题的证据，理由是\"该段明确说主要增长来自数据中心，未提出独立的其他业务争论\"。这是对那一段材料的判断，别的材料要逐个判。</li>\n   317\t<li><b>能核对</b>有一个日期和一份公开材料能把答案放进事先固定的档吗？没有就重写问题。到期没有材料记\"未能判定\"，不算错。</li>\n   318\t<li><b>不是重复</b>和已有问题比，只是预测值、措辞、来源、方向或同一总量的另一种口径不同，最终核对的是同一个结果吗？是就是同一题。抽取看不到库<span class=\"src\">D211</span>，这一条在抽取时只对同一篇文章里提出的几个问题判；和库里的比由匹配做。</li>\n   319\t</ol>\n   320\t<p>另外三条写法检查<span class=\"src\">评审 §1 第 1、5、6 条</span>。没过的问题不能照原样开，要重写；重写不了就不开，材料作证据。</p>\n   321\t<ul>\n   322\t<li><b>原文支持：</b>主体、量或事件、时间依据都能在原文找到。原文没给日期、而规则允许研究员定检查日的，用那个日期并标明：没写日期的待决监管事项用本财年末（第 3 节 E 类）；还没签的约束性义务用文章后 18 个月以内能核对签约的那天<span class=\"src\">D185、D210</span>。不把\"拟议\"\"预计\"写成\"已签\"\"已完成\"。</li>\n   323\t<li><b>口径完整：</b>算谁、不算谁、算什么写清楚；支出、融资、担保、订单、收入不混。</li>\n   324\t<li><b>时间正确：</b>原文支持这个期间，不把几年的平均写成今年。</li>\n   325\t</ul>\n   326\t\n   327\t<h3>不开的<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6 的清单</span></h3>\n   328\t<div class=\"table-wrap mid\"><table>\n   329\t<thead><tr><th>不开</th><th>出处</th><th>它变成什么</th></tr></thead>\n   330\t<tbody>\n   331\t<tr><td>季度数字和季度指引</td><td>第 1 版 §6；PRD 06 梯子第 6 条</td><td>证据</td></tr>\n   332\t<tr><td>同一段指引里的每一行（\"费用率、税率是模型输入，不是争论\"）</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据</td></tr>\n   333\t<tr><td>没日期的\"护城河\"\"战略\"</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据</td></tr>\n   334\t<tr><td>高管任免、股东投票、回购授权；章程</td><td>第 1 版 §6；章程出自 D239 选定的 role-v29 原文（\"executive appointments, shareholder votes or bylaws\"）</td><td>证据或不留</td></tr>\n   335\t<tr><td>例行诉讼程序</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据</td></tr>\n   336\t<tr><td>客户的部署计划（\"它是供应商需求和产品问题的证据，除非改变供应商自己的现金或信用风险\"）</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据；改变公司自己的现金或信用风险时按 C 类判</td></tr>\n   337\t<tr><td>以约束性义务为理由开：公司自己借钱、自己的租约、已完成或没写规模的投资。它们不是约束性义务；对别的问题仍可以是证据，或按别的开题理由判</td><td>D236、D238</td><td>证据</td></tr>\n   338\t<tr><td>把远期年度预测改装成事件</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据</td></tr>\n   339\t<tr><td>后年及以后的年度量（约束性义务除外）</td><td>PRD 06 梯子第 5 条；D185</td><td>证据</td></tr>\n   340\t<tr><td>同一个量的另一个估计、另一种口径、另一个来源</td><td>第 1 版 §6 测试 4</td><td>那个已开问题的证据，由匹配并入</td></tr>\n   341\t</tbody></table></div>\n   342\t\n   343\t<h3>同一题、续期，还是另一题：匹配这一步的事，抽取不判库里的</h3>\n   344\t<ul>\n   345\t<li><b>总规则：</b>同一个结果能判掉两题，就是同一题；答案能分开走、而且分析员会分别下注的，才是另一题<span class=\"src\">D248</span>。</li>\n   346\t<li><b>同一题：</b>同一个结果能同时判两个问题。另一个估计、来源、措辞、方向<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6 测试 4</span>；同一总量的另一种人群或代用口径（D190 碰撞裁决提示 collision-v1：\"another population or proxy of one aggregate\"；D197 引的 role-v12 原文：\"another population or another wording of the same aggregate is evidence to the shown aggregate thesis\"）。候选并进已开问题，用它的结果档和到期日<span class=\"src\">PRD 06</span>。只有以共同量理由开题、带量的候选由代码自动判，其余是匹配和碰撞裁决的判断。</li>\n   347\t<li><b>同一个计划的几种说法</b>（担保、融资承诺、信用支持……），最后核对的是同一个数，是一题<span class=\"src\">D248 第 1 条</span>。</li>\n   348\t<li><b>同一件事的不同截止日：</b>早的那题开着时，晚的截止日是它的证据，不另开；早的到期没有结果、事情还在追，系统开下一个截止日的续期题，带上并进来的证据，不等新文章<span class=\"src\">D248 第 2 条</span>。</li>\n   349\t<li><b>同一代产品的几个里程碑：</b>一题，问能带来收入的那一步（通常是开始出货）；送样、发布作证据；会分别下注的里程碑（新药的三期数据和获批）各一题<span class=\"src\">D248 第 3 条</span>。</li>\n   350\t<li><b>公司自己的量：</b>只按财年开题；按日历年的估计是财年那题的证据，两种年份差得多时分量低一点<span class=\"src\">D248 第 4 条；PRD 06 梯子第 5 条</span>。</li>\n   351\t<li><b>身份：</b>事件和政策题里模型写的期间起点，不拿来挡合并；对象、事件、截止日照旧核对<span class=\"src\">D248 第 5 条</span>。</li>\n   352\t<li><b>续期：</b>同一个量或同一串事件的下一个期间<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 Succession、D190</span>。</li>\n   353\t<li><b>另一题：</b>同一件事里答案能分开走、分析员会分别下注的：有自己驱动的组成部分；同一笔交易或同一份附注里两个各自会变、分别盯着的数；另一件事<span class=\"src\">D190 碰撞裁决的四种；D248 第 1 条收窄了\"担保和融资\"</span>。</li>\n   354\t<li><b>约束性义务：</b>\"一笔或一个计划\"一题<span class=\"src\">D210</span>；一笔交易是不是某个已按金额开题的计划的一部分，由匹配判，是就并入<span class=\"src\">D248 第 1 条</span>。还没签的单笔交易是\"签不签\"的是非题，照旧可以开，不并进计划的金额题<span class=\"src\">D210；PRD 06；D248 未改</span>。</li>\n   355\t<li><b>共同量：</b>以共同量理由开题、带量的候选（量的类别是 <code>other</code> 的不算），由代码按\"主题＋量＋期间\"判同一题；政策阶段和别的事件保留按事件判的身份；不带这个开题理由的主题量由模型判<span class=\"src\">D197</span>。</li>\n   356\t</ul>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"**Version 2 fixes the explicit year-on-year comparison problem, but I would not call the new sentence fully aligned with the standard.** It permits a 2027 price compared with 2026, yet its broad exclusions could still make the model overlook a valid calendar-year figure when that figure appears inside a rolling or multi-year statement.\n\nFor example, an article could give an average across several years **and** a separate figure for next calendar year. The words “an average or total over several years … is not this reason’s period” correctly reject the multi-year average as the question’s period, but do not tell the model to assess the separately stated annual figure on its own.\n\nThe diff changes only the shared-quantity sentence in [c17-system.txt](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c17-system.txt:102). The closing check and schema are identical to c8.\n\nThe changed sentence contains several distinct instructions:\n\n| Changed wording | Verdict | Signed standard |\n|---|---|---|\n| “for **one calendar year, this year or next**” | **Consistent.** | “自然年的今年或明年” and “一个问题只问一个量的一个期间” in [§3](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:280). |\n| “a figure over a **rolling twelve months … is not this reason’s period**” | **Consistent in its literal reading.** A rolling twelve-month period is not necessarily a calendar year. | The standard specifies “自然年的今年或明年” in [§3](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:280). It does not separately spell out rolling periods. |\n| “an **average or total over several years** is not this reason’s period” | **Consistent for the multi-year measure itself**, but potentially narrower in application if read as excluding a separately stated calendar-year figure in the same statement. | “一个问题只问一个量的一个期间” and “不把几年的平均写成今年” in [§3–4](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:302). The latter explicitly names an average; the calendar-year rule also supports excluding a multi-year total as the period. |\n| “while **a calendar year compared with the year before it is**” | **Consistent.** | The standard expressly gives “2027 年 DRAM 合约价相对 2026 年的变化” as an example in [§3](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:288). |\n| “**whether a statement is kept is judged as evidence**” | **Consistent.** | “哪一类都不属于的不开；它是不是证据、挂到哪，照第 5 节和归档规则” in [§3](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:297). |\n\nOn the rest of the request, I see **no direct contradiction** with the four sentences named in the question. The new sentence governs whether a *new question* fits the shared-quantity period; the other sentences govern whether an existing question covers a statement and whether the statement should be kept and linked. The closing check reinforces that distinction by retaining material evidence even when no new question qualifies.\n\nThere is still an **ambiguity in application**. “Not this reason’s period” is attached to “a figure,” while “whether a statement is kept” comes immediately afterward. A model could apply the period exclusion to the whole statement rather than just the proposed question. That would conflict in practice with “Do not exclude evidence solely because it concerns a related period” and with the instruction to link evidence to every question it informs. This is a risk from the wording, not a demonstrated model failure.\n\nThe new examples are abstract period shapes, so they are **industry-neutral** and name no company, product, or numeric value. They agree with the schema: its question period and evidence period are strings, and its summary can preserve the comparison. The existing shared-quantity examples remain industry-specific illustrations—container capacity and a raw-material contract price—but do not name a covered company or product. The calendar-year comparison example agrees with the standard; the schema permits it, though it does not itself enforce the calendar-year rule.\n\nFor the three specific risks:\n\n1. **Next year against this year:** The added “a calendar year compared with the year before it is” directly permits 2027 against 2026. It reduces the previous risk, but “for one calendar year” could still lead a model to rewrite the question as the 2027 price alone and lose the comparison. The request elsewhere says to preserve periods and comparisons, so this is an ambiguity rather than an explicit instruction to remove them.\n2. **A calendar-year figure that should open:** Yes, potentially, when it appears alongside a rolling or multi-year figure. “A figure over a rolling twelve months” and “an average or total over several years” do not explicitly distinguish that measure from a separate eligible annual measure in the same passage.\n3. **Evidence that is kept:** The sentence explicitly says to judge keeping separately, so it does not instruct the model to discard or reshape it. The risk is overextending “not this reason’s period” to the evidence itself, or dropping the comparison while summarizing it; the existing instructions to preserve the measure, period and comparison argue against that reading.\n\nThis is a read-only text audit. It identifies plausible readings of the request; it does not establish what the model actually does on a stored input."}}
